1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,600
This is Mindspace.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:06,000
Everything I save during the day lands here:

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
screenshots, things I read,
thoughts I say out loud.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,000
One note, four captures.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,500
A voice memo, a paragraph I clipped
from a search, a screenshot.

6
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:22,000
Each one keeps where it came from
and what I was thinking.

7
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:26,000
Then Gemini reads the whole note
and writes it up.

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,800
Four captures, two sources, five threads.

9
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:32,500
My own notes stay next to it,
never replaced.

10
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,800
Here is the thing.

11
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:38,500
I am building the pitch
for this hackathon in Figma,

12
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:42,500
and that work is also something
I will want back later.

13
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:46,000
So I capture it.

14
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:51,000
The moon catches it without taking me
out of what I am doing.

15
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,500
It knows the app, the time,

16
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:57,500
and it lets me leave a note for future me.

17
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,500
This is where it is going.

18
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:02,500
Mind, the mobile twin.

19
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:05,500
Your folders become arcs around the moon,

20
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:10,000
sized by how much of your thinking
lives in each one.

21
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:14,000
And I am capturing that too,
while I build it.

22
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:17,000
The prompt, the interface, the decision.

23
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Mindspace is how this project
remembers itself.

24
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:24,500
Speech is on device.

25
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:27,000
It transcribes while I talk,

26
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,000
so a thought I had walking between rooms

27
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,000
ends up in the same place
as everything else.

28
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:36,500
Saved to the note.

29
00:01:36,500 --> 00:01:39,500
No window opened, nothing interrupted,

30
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:42,500
and it is already part
of what I can ask about.

31
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Which is the whole point.

32
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Everything I saved, everything I thought,

33
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:51,000
in one place I can talk to.

34
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:54,000
What did I save about pricing?

35
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:58,200
Imagine you could Cmd + F your brain.
